  "cves": [
    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-19426",
      "publishedDate": "2026-08-12T07:07:00.768Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-08-12T09:12:53.496Z",
      "description": "POS System developed by FitSoft has a Missing Authentication vulnerability. Unauthenticated remote attackers can directly access and operate the system.",
      "severity": "8.2",
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：FitSoft POS System\n🔓 漏洞类型：Missing Authentication for Critical Function (CWE-306)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://www.twcert.org.tw/tw/cp-132-11100-407c5-1.html",
          "type": "reference"
        },
        {
